sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant T as Terminal signer
    participant A as Main Agent A
    participant B as Service Agent B
    participant S as Service verifier
    U->>A: Task request
    A-->>U: Plan and requested scopes
    U->>T: Approve and authenticate
    T->>T: Sign G0 locally
    T->>A: G0 bound to A, delegation
    A->>B: Verify identity and key
    B-->>A: Key-bound identity proof
    A->>A: Attenuate and sign G1
    A->>B: G1 bound to B, parent evidence
    B->>S: Request, G1, evidence and PoP
    S->>S: Verify chain and policy
    alt All checks pass
        S-->>B: Result and receipt
        B-->>A: Result and receipt
        A-->>U: Task completion
    else A check fails
        S-->>B: Reject request
    end
